  <data name="label1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Template v0.0
Mana pupuri © 2026 NataljaNeumann@gmx.de

He pūmanawa kore utu tēnei, i tukuna i raro i te Raihana Tūmatanui o te Kotahitanga o Ūropi (European Union Public Licence - EUPL). Ka taea e koe te whakarerekē i te pūmanawa i raro i ngā tikanga o te EUPL, ā, ka taea hoki te whai wāhi atu mā te tiri i āu whakapainga ki te kaupapa.

He kaupapa e haere tonu ana tēnei, e whakapaingia ana i ngā wā katoa e te tini o ngā kaiwhai wāhi. Ehara tēnei i te hua kua oti, nō reira tērā pea kei roto ētahi hapa, ‘bug’ rānei, he mea noa i roto i tēnei momo tukanga whanaketanga.

Nō reira, ka tukuna tēnei hua i raro i te Raihana i runga i tōna āhua o nāianei, me te kore pūtāhui o ia momo mō te hua nei. Kei roto i tēnei, engari kāore e herea ki ēnei anake: te pai mō te hokohoko, te pai mō tētahi kaupapa motuhake, te kore hapa, te tika o ngā kōrero, me te kore takahi i ngā mana taonga hinengaro (hāunga te mana pupuri).

Haunga ngā take o te whanoke ā-hinengaro, ngā kino rānei i pā tika ki ngā tāngata tūturu, e kore rawa te Kaituku Raihana e whai kawenga mō ngā kino tika, ā-kore rānei, ā-tinana, ā-tikanga, ā-hinengaro rānei, o tētahi momo, e puta mai ana i te Raihana, i te whakamahinga rānei o te Mahi, tae atu ki, engari kāore i te herea ki, ngā kino mō te ngaronga o te ngākau pai, te aukati mahi, te rahunga rorohiko, te hapa rānei, te ngaronga o ngā raraunga, tetahi kino arumoni rānei, ahakoa kua whakamōhiotia te Kaituku Raihana mō te tūponotanga o taua kino. Heoi, ka whai kawenga te Kaituku Raihana i raro i ngā ture herenga hua ture i te mea e pā ana aua ture ki te Mahi.

Raihanahia i raro i te EUPL.
